- How would you adjust RU/s as tenants grow?

## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to map a beginner pipeline to real Azure services under data residency constraints.

## Key Concepts
- Event Hubs ingestion
- Azure Functions processing
- Cosmos DB with Row-Level Security
- Power BI per-tenant dashboards
- EU data residency and BYOK
- DR and cost optimization

## Code Example
```javascript
// Azure Function (JS) sketch: read EventHub message and write to Cosmos with tenant partition
module.exports = async function(context, messages){
  for (const m of messages){
    const item = { id: m.id, tenantId: m.tenantId, ...m.payload };
    await cosmosContainer.items.upsert(item);
  }
}
```

